{"team":"MIN","col":"#A06BE8","identity":"balanced","funnel":"balanced-D","plays_pg":58.4,"adot":8.2,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>A Balanced Attack</h2><p>In the passing game the ball funnels to <strong>Justin Jefferson</strong> \u2014 <strong>30% of targets</strong> (league ~23%), a genuine alpha share that concentrates the receiving value at the top.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>MIN throw by design. They pass <strong>+1%</strong> over expectation (league -2%) and keep firing even with a lead (42% early-down pass when ahead vs ~41%) \u2014 the kind of pass-first identity that keeps receivers live in every script.</p><p>They're a heavy under-center team (54% shotgun vs ~68%) \u2014 a pro-style, run-committed structure.</p><p>The WR2 is unusually involved here \u2014 <strong>18%</strong> of targets (league ~15%), meaning there's bankable volume beyond the top receiver.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 59% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><p>This is a deliberate, low-volume offense \u2014 just <strong>58 plays a game</strong> (league ~61), which quietly caps the ceiling on everybody's targets and carries.</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Inside the 20 they stay aggressive, throwing <strong>61%</strong> of the time, which puts scoring equity on <strong>Justin Jefferson</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 A Balanced Defense</h2><p><strong>Soft against opposing WR2s</strong> \u2014 53 rec yds/game (vs ~36). A rec-yards target.</p><p>They surrender <strong>109 rushing</strong> and <strong>220 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). No dominant funnel \u2014 read it matchup by matchup.</p><p>They lock down backs out of the backfield \u2014 just 12 rec yds/game (vs ~18); fade receiving props there.</p><p>A stingy, efficient defense \u2014 just 41% success allowed (vs ~44%); temper expectations for opposing skill players.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs).</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Kyler Murray","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":23,"props":{"Comp":21.71,"Att":32.2,"Pass Yds":220.41,"Pass TD":1.36,"INT":1.58,"Rush Yds":19.48},"d":{"completions":21.71,"attempts":32.2,"pass_yards":220.41,"pass_td":1.36,"interceptions":1.58,"rush_att":3.3,"rush_yards":19.48}}],"RB":[{"name":"Aaron Jones","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":33,"props":{"Rush Att":16.19,"Rush Yds":76.13,"Tgt":5.4,"Rec":4.26,"Rec Yds":32.54},"d":{"rush_att":16.19,"rush_yards":76.13,"targets":5.4,"receptions":4.26,"rec_yards":32.54,"rec_td":0.15}},{"name":"Jordan Mason","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":21,"props":{"Rush Att":8.31,"Rush Yds":41.74,"Tgt":2.25,"Rec":1.83,"Rec Yds":11.32},"d":{"rush_att":8.31,"rush_yards":41.74,"targets":2.25,"receptions":1.83,"rec_yards":11.32,"rec_td":0.03}},{"name":"Demond Claiborne","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":13,"props":{"Rush Att":2.87,"Rush Yds":12.64,"Tgt":1.3,"Rec":0.87,"Rec Yds":6.49},"d":{"rush_att":2.87,"rush_yards":12.64,"targets":1.3,"receptions":0.87,"rec_yards":6.49,"rec_td":0.03}}],"WR":[{"name":"Justin Jefferson","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":28,"props":{"Tgt":11.87,"Rec":7.98,"Rec Yds":113.48,"Rec TD":0.33},"d":{"targets":11.87,"receptions":7.98,"rec_yards":113.48,"rec_td":0.33}},{"name":"Jordan Addison","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":23,"props":{"Tgt":6.58,"Rec":4.03,"Rec Yds":52.87,"Rec TD":0.27},"d":{"targets":6.58,"receptions":4.03,"rec_yards":52.87,"rec_td":0.27}},{"name":"Jauan Jennings","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":24,"props":{"Tgt":8.1,"Rec":5.15,"Rec Yds":63.39,"Rec TD":0.28},"d":{"targets":8.1,"receptions":5.15,"rec_yards":63.39,"rec_td":0.28}},{"name":"Tai Felton","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":7,"props":{"Tgt":3.06,"Rec":1.76,"Rec Yds":21.2,"Rec T